"nextHypothesis":"Add one explicit precedence line to the scenario/authoring brief: 'for isolated authoring, do NOT run sdd-log authoring-complete; leave Handoff pending-operator even when sdd-check prints ready,' and name default language/test framework. Test whether that removes the STEP_5_CLOSE conflict and reduces speculative repo listing calls."}
